WEBVTT

00:11.544 --> 00:15.173
Hanaukyo Maid Team

00:15.749 --> 00:21.153
Open a window in the morning.

00:21.221 --> 00:28.127
Flowers of light
surround the world.

00:29.195 --> 00:35.100
As if the hidden
feeling in my heart...

00:35.168 --> 00:41.596
...is melting away now.

00:43.176 --> 00:48.079
I'm holding
the fragrance of the season.

00:49.149 --> 00:55.782
I pray to you...

00:55.855 --> 00:58.756
I wanted to meet you...

00:58.825 --> 01:02.556
...ever since the day I was born.

01:02.629 --> 01:05.462
Only you...

01:05.532 --> 01:09.969
...I want to protect only you.

01:10.036 --> 01:12.300
Just you...

01:12.372 --> 01:14.704
...I want to touch.

01:15.775 --> 01:20.712
My hand is going to hold you.

01:22.549 --> 01:24.312
I want to deliver.

01:25.885 --> 01:28.149
Voice of my heart.

01:50.376 --> 01:55.279
Ryuka Again

02:02.288 --> 02:03.619
Ariake...

02:03.690 --> 02:05.453
I am back!

02:07.994 --> 02:10.155
Hey, Ikuyo-chan.

02:10.230 --> 02:11.788
Yes?

02:11.865 --> 02:13.457
Well, what is...

02:14.901 --> 02:15.868
...this?

02:15.935 --> 02:17.095
Taro-sama...

02:17.170 --> 02:20.298
I explained it thoroughly
earlier, didn't I?

02:24.844 --> 02:27.213
The Comic Manga Market,
also known as "Comake."

02:27.213 --> 02:28.314
Comake Maniac Hall of Fame
Tokyo Big Site
The Comic Manga Market,
also known as "Comake."

02:28.314 --> 02:31.484
Comake Maniac Hall of Fame
Tokyo Big Site
It's the world-class level
sales spot for dojinshi.

02:31.484 --> 02:31.779
It's the world-class level
sales spot for dojinshi.

02:31.851 --> 02:33.079
We draw manga...

02:33.153 --> 02:34.586
...print them into books...

02:34.654 --> 02:35.712
...and sell them.

02:35.788 --> 02:36.880
Sell at any cost.

02:36.956 --> 02:39.151
Sell, sell, and keep selling!

02:39.893 --> 02:41.986
This is...

02:42.061 --> 02:43.289
...Comake!

02:43.463 --> 02:44.953
Therefore, everyone.

02:45.031 --> 02:48.194
I want you to work
very hard today.

02:48.268 --> 02:49.462
What?

02:49.536 --> 02:51.128
I'm sorry.

02:51.204 --> 02:53.695
I didn't think this
place was so big.

02:53.773 --> 02:55.206
Come on, everyone!

02:55.275 --> 02:57.243
This way, this way!

03:01.147 --> 03:04.412
I thought it was something
since the head himself came.

03:04.484 --> 03:06.748
I followed instinctively...

03:06.819 --> 03:08.514
...but what is this crowd?

03:13.927 --> 03:14.723
Huh? Huh?

03:18.765 --> 03:21.097
West Hall 4th Floor
(Industry Booths, Cosplay Area)

03:30.310 --> 03:31.470
This is it.

03:31.544 --> 03:32.841
Our space.

03:37.784 --> 03:41.584
We will now be opening
the Comic Manga Market.

03:52.298 --> 03:55.665
Did you hear about the really
cute cosplaying salesgirls?

03:55.735 --> 03:57.930
For real? Where? Where?

04:01.174 --> 04:03.142
Welcome!

04:12.118 --> 04:14.348
Mariel sells dojinshi.

04:16.889 --> 04:18.652
Parasol pikaru!

04:18.725 --> 04:20.522
Chloform!

04:20.593 --> 04:23.118
I love Konoe-shama!
A new book is out!

04:25.265 --> 04:28.063
With the new book,
I am going to...

04:28.935 --> 04:31.529
...search and destroy your heart.

04:35.275 --> 04:37.800
Buy the book
or you're a bad boy.

04:39.712 --> 04:41.270
Welcome!

04:45.985 --> 04:47.646
You're fired up, aren't you?

04:47.720 --> 04:48.948
Of course!

04:49.022 --> 04:53.049
I ditched work and worked hard
on making costumes for this day.

04:54.127 --> 04:55.116
Ikuyo.

04:55.194 --> 04:56.559
What do you think you're doing?

04:57.463 --> 04:59.294
K-Konoe-san...

04:59.365 --> 05:01.424
You look very good in it!

05:01.501 --> 05:02.934
Y-You...

05:04.704 --> 05:05.932
W-Who?

05:12.445 --> 05:14.777
Bringing dangerous
things is prohibited.

05:14.847 --> 05:17.213
Please come to ops for a bit.

05:17.283 --> 05:19.478
Impossible,
I didn't sense a thing...

05:19.552 --> 05:23.249
Honestly, vendor morals
have really gone down lately.

05:23.323 --> 05:24.620
Konoe-shama!

05:27.727 --> 05:30.719
Against the infamously
tough Comake staff...

05:30.797 --> 05:32.924
...Konoe-san is like a baby.

05:32.999 --> 05:35.092
It's a big world, isn't it.

05:35.168 --> 05:36.294
Hey.

05:37.503 --> 05:39.300
We don't have enough staff.

05:39.372 --> 05:41.135
Oh, Grace?

05:41.207 --> 05:43.300
Never mind me, look at that.

05:44.844 --> 05:48.143
If you have time
to chitchat, you can work, too!

05:49.782 --> 05:51.807
I-I understand.

05:53.419 --> 05:54.283
I swear.

05:54.354 --> 05:58.654
Anyway, why do I have
to say stuff like "waffo"?

06:00.760 --> 06:02.125
What's with the stare?

06:02.195 --> 06:05.028
Nothing, you just
seem to be having fun...

06:06.733 --> 06:07.859
Shut up!

06:08.468 --> 06:09.958
Ouch!

06:32.091 --> 06:34.252
Thank you very much.

06:35.027 --> 06:36.892
Thank you, Mariel.

06:36.963 --> 06:39.625
A big part of the work
seems to be over.

06:39.699 --> 06:41.166
Aren't you tired?

06:41.234 --> 06:42.394
No.

06:42.468 --> 06:44.698
Grace-chan and
the others worked hard, too.

06:52.044 --> 06:56.071
We sold a lot of books,
so Ikuyo-chan must be satisfied.

06:56.149 --> 06:57.673
Not at all.

06:58.317 --> 07:02.481
Do you think we can climb up to
the Comake top with this much?

07:02.555 --> 07:03.385
Yes?

07:03.456 --> 07:07.222
We did have a good start with
the maid team cosplay plan.

07:07.293 --> 07:10.194
But that's just a burst
of plan harmony.

07:10.263 --> 07:12.697
I want something explosive.

07:12.765 --> 07:17.259
An explosive burst to break
stereotypes and open new worlds!

07:23.142 --> 07:24.473
W-What's wrong?

07:25.711 --> 07:28.271
Taro-sama, you're surprisingly...

07:28.347 --> 07:29.644
W-What?

07:33.953 --> 07:35.386
Wait, Ikuyo-chan!

07:35.455 --> 07:36.479
That's...

07:36.556 --> 07:37.750
No!

07:37.824 --> 07:39.792
Welcome!

07:41.828 --> 07:43.921
Hey, look at that girl.

07:43.996 --> 07:45.827
Wow, she's cute.

07:52.004 --> 07:53.494
Come on, Taro-sama.

07:53.573 --> 07:55.097
Service, service!

07:55.174 --> 07:56.607
Service...

07:58.711 --> 08:00.906
You are very beautiful,
Taro-sama.

08:01.414 --> 08:02.745
Mariel...

08:02.815 --> 08:04.442
Taro-sama.

08:06.018 --> 08:09.010
T-Today, we have new books!

08:09.088 --> 08:11.648
It looks like that's a boy!

08:11.724 --> 08:14.124
No way,
he's prettier than me!

08:16.128 --> 08:17.254
Taro-sama.

08:17.330 --> 08:19.628
Come on,
wrap it up all at once!

08:19.699 --> 08:22.361
I think dirty dojinshi are bad!

08:26.906 --> 08:27.668
Cute!

08:27.740 --> 08:29.037
B-Bursting!

08:29.108 --> 08:30.370
All right!

08:49.228 --> 08:51.458
What in the world is this place?

08:52.932 --> 08:53.626
Huh?

08:57.837 --> 09:00.101
- Welcome.
- What is this?

09:00.172 --> 09:02.572
I didn't know such
books were out.

09:02.642 --> 09:04.132
I'll buy it.

09:04.210 --> 09:06.576
I'll buy everything here!

09:11.717 --> 09:12.945
Where am I?

09:15.888 --> 09:17.446
It's a big catch.

09:21.961 --> 09:23.519
That hurt.

09:23.596 --> 09:25.291
Watch where you're going.

09:25.932 --> 09:27.399
I'm sorry.

09:27.466 --> 09:28.660
I wasn't paying attention.

09:32.772 --> 09:34.000
Honestly.

09:34.073 --> 09:35.404
Be careful.

09:36.208 --> 09:37.573
Ryuka-san?

09:41.647 --> 09:42.511
Midget?

09:44.450 --> 09:45.781
Midget...

09:45.851 --> 09:47.614
You're as harsh as always.

09:48.988 --> 09:51.684
I found you, Taro Hanaukyo!

09:56.929 --> 09:57.918
Honestly.

09:57.997 --> 10:00.625
Why does it have
to be like this? Besides...

10:00.700 --> 10:03.863
Why is it you look so
good in women's clothes?

10:05.905 --> 10:06.803
Oh?

10:06.872 --> 10:09.864
You like books about
fighter jets and guns.

10:11.978 --> 10:15.379
T-This is part of my
study to become family head...

10:15.448 --> 10:17.882
...t-to know what
the general public wants...

10:18.684 --> 10:21.949
Since Taro is here,
the others must be nearby, too...

10:22.655 --> 10:25.385
This isn't good.
If they see me...

10:25.458 --> 10:27.892
I-I'll be destroyed!

10:27.960 --> 10:30.827
The Jihioh family's
fame, its authority...

10:31.964 --> 10:35.764
Well, if you want to laugh at me,
laugh as much as you want!

10:35.835 --> 10:36.995
I won't laugh.

10:37.903 --> 10:42.340
You bought this many books
because you like them, right?

10:43.743 --> 10:47.338
I think it's wonderful to do
your best at what you like.

10:48.748 --> 10:51.842
But if you don't
want me to, then...

10:51.917 --> 10:53.680
Yeah, I won't tell anyone.

10:55.988 --> 10:58.081
Here you are, Taro-sama.

10:58.791 --> 11:01.487
Oh, and Ryuka-sama.

11:01.560 --> 11:02.527
Mariel...

11:02.595 --> 11:03.721
Mariel.

11:03.796 --> 11:04.785
That's right.

11:04.864 --> 11:06.832
Hey, what happened afterwards?

11:06.899 --> 11:09.527
Well, the chaos
calmed down quietly...

11:09.602 --> 11:11.729
...and the books sold out earlier.

11:11.804 --> 11:12.930
I see.

11:13.005 --> 11:14.233
I'm glad.

11:14.306 --> 11:16.638
Come, everyone is waiting.

11:16.709 --> 11:17.641
Yeah.

11:18.911 --> 11:21.175
Well, Ryuka-san, see you again.

11:21.814 --> 11:22.838
Taro.

11:22.915 --> 11:25.475
It's all right.
I'll keep my promise.

11:25.551 --> 11:27.143
Excuse us.

11:42.368 --> 11:47.101
Hanaukyo Maid Team

11:55.414 --> 11:56.904
It's peaceful...

12:00.953 --> 12:02.750
A guest, maybe?

12:16.902 --> 12:18.494
I knew it was you.

12:18.571 --> 12:19.970
Welcome, Ryuka-san.

12:20.039 --> 12:22.940
There you are, Taro Hanaukyo.

12:23.008 --> 12:25.442
I inform those of
the Hanaukyo family.

12:25.511 --> 12:28.139
Ryuka, the Jihioh
family's next head...

12:28.214 --> 12:32.674
...starting today, has decided to
work as a Hanaukyo family maid.

12:39.792 --> 12:40.816
In other words...

12:40.893 --> 12:45.023
...this is part of your study
to become Jihioh family head?

12:45.397 --> 12:46.694
That's right.

12:46.766 --> 12:48.358
As the next head...

12:48.434 --> 12:51.528
...I need to know what
it means to work, too.

12:51.904 --> 12:53.303
Wow...

12:53.372 --> 12:56.864
You have noble ideas,
despite your appearance.

12:58.744 --> 13:01.008
Despite whose appearance?

13:04.116 --> 13:05.014
You!

13:05.084 --> 13:06.745
What are you
doing to Taro-sama?

13:08.053 --> 13:12.012
By the way, you haven't told
anyone about "that", have you?

13:12.091 --> 13:13.649
"That"...

13:13.726 --> 13:15.216
The Comake thing?

13:15.294 --> 13:16.659
Keep your voice down!

13:16.729 --> 13:19.425
Honestly, I can't
trust you, after all.

13:19.498 --> 13:20.965
All right.

13:21.033 --> 13:24.366
Starting today, I'll keep
an eye on you for a while.

13:24.436 --> 13:27.769
I suppose that's the real
reason you came here?

13:27.840 --> 13:29.774
O-Of course...

13:29.842 --> 13:32.310
Or why else would I have to...

13:32.378 --> 13:34.175
Anyway, that's why.

13:34.246 --> 13:35.736
So, Mariel.

13:35.815 --> 13:39.012
Give me a post worthy
of a noble right away.

13:39.084 --> 13:40.176
There are none.

13:41.554 --> 13:42.077
Huh?

13:42.154 --> 13:45.146
The Hanaukyo family
has no department...

13:45.224 --> 13:47.556
...that's currently
accepting extra staff.

13:49.261 --> 13:50.057
You kid.

13:50.129 --> 13:50.993
None.

13:51.063 --> 13:52.553
One or two.

13:52.631 --> 13:53.427
None.

13:56.035 --> 13:57.730
Don't be ridiculous!

13:57.803 --> 14:00.397
Then what do you suggest I do?

14:01.140 --> 14:03.233
You can leave now.

14:03.309 --> 14:06.710
Or you just need
to find a job on your own.

14:08.414 --> 14:11.440
Well then, I have work to do.

14:11.517 --> 14:12.677
Excuse me.

14:23.295 --> 14:26.059
That girl's become
mean, hasn't she?

14:26.932 --> 14:28.593
You're one to talk.

14:28.667 --> 14:29.793
What was that?

14:29.869 --> 14:31.666
It's the truth, isn't it?

14:34.240 --> 14:35.764
All right!

14:35.841 --> 14:39.299
Then I'll find something by
myself one way or the other!

14:41.647 --> 14:45.481
Is that why you came
to me immediately?

14:45.551 --> 14:49.954
I've attained full proficiency in the
Jihioh style of Japanese halberd.

14:50.022 --> 14:50.784
But...

14:56.362 --> 14:58.592
I'm pretty good at this, too.

14:58.664 --> 15:01.326
If you'd like,
I don't mind being tested.

15:01.400 --> 15:03.493
No, it's not necessary.

15:04.703 --> 15:07.672
You're indeed the head
of the security department.

15:07.740 --> 15:10.436
You're fully aware of my ability.

15:11.477 --> 15:12.739
I'll ask one thing.

15:12.811 --> 15:14.039
Do you know...

15:14.113 --> 15:16.809
...what the security department's
most important job is?

15:16.882 --> 15:19.112
That's obvious.

15:19.184 --> 15:21.778
It's to protect Taro
from the enemy, isn't it?

15:21.854 --> 15:23.321
That is right.

15:23.389 --> 15:24.651
So...

15:25.758 --> 15:29.694
Why must we hire our enemy,
the Jihioh family's boss?

15:32.765 --> 15:37.134
Honestly, the security
department's staff lacks flexibility.

15:37.202 --> 15:38.897
Don't you think so?

15:38.971 --> 15:42.566
Unfortunately, we're more
inflexible than they are.

15:42.641 --> 15:44.666
Outsiders need to leave.

15:44.743 --> 15:46.608
What a cheeky kid.

15:47.613 --> 15:52.277
I heard you're that Cynthia's
other personality, aren't you?

15:52.351 --> 15:57.584
Considering that, you don't have
a lovable nature, do you?

16:00.192 --> 16:03.423
Cleaning staff?
I dumped incombustible trash.

16:03.495 --> 16:06.191
Keep it in
the basement fusion reactor.

16:19.545 --> 16:20.944
The response was good...

16:21.013 --> 16:24.915
Simone Edashima will be #1 at
the Comake this winter for sure!

16:29.788 --> 16:31.016
Honestly.

16:31.090 --> 16:33.991
The Hanaukyo family has
no decent departments.

16:34.059 --> 16:35.924
But I won't lose.

16:35.995 --> 16:38.987
I will never leave the mansion!

17:28.280 --> 17:30.145
That's the end of the report.

17:30.916 --> 17:32.884
Ryuka-san is amazing.

17:32.951 --> 17:36.910
I will bill all the damages
to the Jihioh family.

17:36.989 --> 17:37.956
Taro-sama...

17:38.023 --> 17:42.585
Are you really going to let her
stay in the mansion like this?

17:42.661 --> 17:44.686
Is there any problem?

17:44.763 --> 17:49.097
For now, her actions remain
those of a laughingstock.

17:49.168 --> 17:53.571
But she is the next head
of the Jihioh family, after all.

17:53.639 --> 17:56.472
She'll show her true
nature someday and harm...

17:56.542 --> 17:58.476
She's not that kind of person.

18:00.446 --> 18:05.349
Ryuka-san's a person who can
do her best for her favorite things.

18:05.417 --> 18:08.352
One like Ryuka-san
can't be a bad person.

18:08.420 --> 18:10.911
For her favorite things?

18:10.989 --> 18:11.751
Yeah.

18:11.824 --> 18:16.625
But I wish she'd
trust me a little more.

18:16.695 --> 18:19.687
I won't tell anyone about "that."

18:25.804 --> 18:28.773
I see. That's what it's all about.

18:28.841 --> 18:31.105
You're a heartless man,
Taro-sama.

18:42.421 --> 18:44.184
What's with them all?

18:44.857 --> 18:46.791
I'm doing my best...

18:50.095 --> 18:52.620
Maybe I should go home...

18:53.699 --> 18:57.066
Starting today, I'll keep
an eye on you for a while.

18:57.136 --> 19:00.162
I suppose that's the real
reason you came here?

19:02.741 --> 19:03.867
Taro...

19:04.643 --> 19:06.042
...you fool.

19:07.546 --> 19:08.604
Hey.

19:08.680 --> 19:10.875
W-What is it?
All of a sudden...

19:10.949 --> 19:14.248
I thought I would give
you a piece of advice.

19:14.319 --> 19:17.186
Taro-sama is insensitive.

19:17.256 --> 19:18.655
What do you want to say?

19:18.724 --> 19:23.184
You need to tell him your real
intentions, or he won't understand.

19:23.262 --> 19:24.229
That's what I mean.

19:26.398 --> 19:29.595
Why did you come
to tell me that?

19:29.668 --> 19:31.226
It is awkward...

19:31.303 --> 19:35.239
...but I don't seem to hate you,
even though you're an enemy.

19:35.307 --> 19:38.606
You calmly accomplish
things I could never do.

19:39.678 --> 19:40.975
What is that?

19:41.046 --> 19:43.310
Nothing. Never mind.

19:43.382 --> 19:48.012
But I'm not so soft as to let
someone nonstaff stay for long.

19:48.954 --> 19:52.583
If you want to stay here,
find a job quickly.

19:56.828 --> 19:58.591
A job...

20:01.667 --> 20:03.032
Hey, you.

20:03.101 --> 20:05.592
Do you want to work with us?

20:06.872 --> 20:08.032
Oh!

20:08.106 --> 20:11.007
There's still someone
left in this mansion...

20:11.076 --> 20:13.374
...who'd speak so kindly to me?

20:14.947 --> 20:17.472
W-What is this outfit?

20:17.549 --> 20:18.607
Yeah, yeah.

20:18.684 --> 20:19.878
You look good.

20:19.952 --> 20:21.817
Your legs are pretty, too.

20:23.689 --> 20:25.281
What in the world...

20:25.357 --> 20:29.259
...are these c-clothes
that reveal one's panties?

20:29.328 --> 20:32.024
This is the uniform of
the personal staff team.

20:32.097 --> 20:34.327
Well, we have a new member.

20:34.399 --> 20:37.095
Let's get Taro-sama's
heart all at once!

20:37.869 --> 20:38.927
Yeah!

20:39.004 --> 20:40.767
H-Heart...

20:40.839 --> 20:41.635
Wait...

20:42.107 --> 20:43.631
Don't pull!

20:43.709 --> 20:45.643
Taro-sama!

20:45.711 --> 20:48.236
We won't let you sleep tonight!

20:48.313 --> 20:50.110
Stop... Wait...

20:50.182 --> 20:52.343
You can't do that!

20:55.854 --> 20:57.617
Good morning,
Mariel, Konoe-san.

20:58.690 --> 20:59.554
What's wrong?

20:59.625 --> 21:00.785
Come, everyone!

21:01.760 --> 21:03.955
Believe in me and come along!

21:04.029 --> 21:05.428
Yeah...

21:12.237 --> 21:13.864
I'm very sorry.

21:13.939 --> 21:17.773
I didn't expect her to take over
your personal staff in a day...

21:19.678 --> 21:21.339
Now that she found a job...

21:21.413 --> 21:24.041
...Ryuka-sama is
a part of our family, right?

21:24.116 --> 21:26.676
A new member, maybe?

21:26.752 --> 21:28.515
Anyway...

21:28.587 --> 21:30.612
...Ryuka-san
is awesome, after all.

21:31.156 --> 21:32.214
Watch.

21:32.291 --> 21:36.489
I will make the personal
staff team a major one.

21:46.004 --> 21:49.303
Please leave everything to us.

21:49.374 --> 21:51.501
Hanaukyo Maid Team.

21:52.577 --> 21:55.705
We're going to take care of you.

21:55.781 --> 21:58.841
Your private personal team.

21:58.917 --> 22:02.011
Always to match your taste.

22:02.087 --> 22:04.317
We're highly motivated.

22:05.357 --> 22:08.520
We polish our minds and bodies.

22:08.593 --> 22:11.528
Tell us anything.

22:11.596 --> 22:23.201
Just want you to be
pleased, to be pleased.

22:24.276 --> 22:34.845
But, but,
what a cold-hearted man.

22:37.122 --> 22:43.220
Look, the stars are beautiful.

22:43.295 --> 22:48.927
Tomorrow sure
will be sunny, too.

22:49.935 --> 22:56.272
Tonight too, in your dream too...

22:56.341 --> 23:00.641
...we serve you.

23:10.555 --> 23:12.887
It'll be nine people
with one more...

23:12.958 --> 23:14.823
Taro-sama, what's the matter?

23:14.893 --> 23:17.191
That's right!
You join too, Mariel.

23:17.262 --> 23:19.822
Episode 6, Budget Contest.

23:19.898 --> 23:20.198
We'll serve you next
time as well, Master.

23:20.198 --> 23:22.567
Next Episode
Budget Contest
We'll serve you next
time as well, Master.

